# nr-office-raster-image: the crate mixdog-raster (sharp replacement of the office stack)

Not compiled: the crate is not a workspace member yet, so cargo was not run on it.

## native/core/Cargo.toml

[workspace] members, in sorted place (after "crates/mixdog-pdf-codec" / before "crates/mixdog-rt" by the list's order):

    "crates/mixdog-raster",

[workspace.dependencies], next to `mixdog-pdf-codec = { path = "crates/mixdog-pdf-codec" }`:

    mixdog-raster = { path = "crates/mixdog-raster" }

The workspace `image` entry already has the png, gif, tiff and webp features (all cached): nothing to change there.

## Cargo.lock and mixdog-workspace-hack

`cargo update --workspace --offline` and `cargo hakari generate` (mixdog-raster depends on image, mixdog-imaging, mixdog-rt,
mixdog-workspace-hack; dev: base64, mixdog-testkit, serde_json; all already in the lock). No new external crate.

