## Consumers (later tasks)

nr-office-raster-canvas and nr-office-raster-svg add modules to this crate (their own fragments add lib.rs lines); the office
crates take `mixdog-raster = { workspace = true }`. No service, protocol method or SERVICE_PENDING name comes from this task.
